|> Exercise
    handle=_dimensional_f_g_f_

    What constraints does the composition
    $$
    f \circ g \circ f
    $$
    impose on the signatures of $f$ and $g$?

    |> Solution

        Signatures of the form

        $$
        \begin{gathered}
        f : [\tA] \ra [\tB] \\
        \up{1.6}g : [\tB] \ra [\tA]
        \end{gathered}
        $$

        are necessary and sufficient, as $g$ ferries
        outputs of $f$ to inputs of $f$.

        |> Image
            style=margin-top:-1em
            src=images/e6_f_g_f_composition.svg